==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/haiː/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|aiː|s=1}}

===Interjection===
{{head|is|interjection}}

# {{lb|is|informal}} [[hi]]

====Synonyms====
* {{m|is|halló}}
* {{m|is|sæll}}
* {{m|is|sæll og blessaður}}

====Usage notes====
{{m|is|hæ|Hæ}} is a relatively informal greeting, but very common. The greetings {{m|is|sæll}}, {{m|is|blessaður}}, {{m|is|góðan daginn}} and {{m|is|góða kvöldið}} are more appropriate in formal situations.

The use of {{m|is|hæ}} and {{m|is|bæ}} (corresponding to English {{m|en|hi}} and {{m|en|bye}}) was frowned upon by older speakers well into the 2000s.

